      "headline": "Prime Minister Youth Loan Scheme 2026: Complete Application, Eligibility & Tiers Guide",
      "description": "Apply online for the Prime Minister Youth Loan Scheme 2026. Discover Tier 1 to Tier 3 financing up to Rs 7.5M, 0% markup terms, eligibility, and step-by-step portal rules.",
